I </span><span begin="00:35.201" end="00:35.805">can </span><span begin="00:36.621" end="00:37.189">cover </span><span begin="00:37.405" end="00:37.637">up </span><span begin="00:37.637" end="00:37.909">my </span><span begin="00:37.909" end="00:38.509">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.508" end="00:43.516"><span begin="00:39.508" end="00:39.924">Don't </span><span begin="00:40.660" end="00:41.164">cry </span><span begin="00:41.996" end="00:42.244">I </span><span begin="00:42.244" end="00:42.564">am </span><span begin="00:42.564" end="00:42.892">just </span><span begin="00:42.892" end="00:43.236">a </span><span begin="00:43.236" end="00:43.516">freak</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.372" end="00:48.804"><span begin="00:47.372" end="00:47.588">I </span><span begin="00:47.588" end="00:47.868">am </span><span begin="00:47.868" end="00:48.196">just </span><span begin="00:48.196" end="00:48.548">a </span><span begin="00:48.548" end="00:48.804">freak</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.652" end="00:54.172"><span begin="00:52.652" end="00:52.892">I </span><span begin="00:52.892" end="00:53.212">am </span><span begin="00:53.212" end="00:53.516">just </span><span begin="00:53.516" end="00:53.868">a </span><span begin="00:53.868" end="00:54.172">freak</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.916" end="00:59.538"><span begin="00:57.916" end="00:58.196">I </span><span begin="00:58.196" end="00:58.516">am </span><span begin="00:58.516" end="00:58.828">just </span><span begin="00:58.828" end="00:59.180">a </span><span begin="00:59.180" end="00:59.538">freak</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.884" end="01:26.658"><span begin="01:20.884" end="01:21.260">My </span><span begin="01:22.124" end="01:22.532">head </span><span begin="01:23.507" end="01:24.100">is </span><span begin="01:24.780" end="01:25.076">filled </span><span begin="01:25.076" end="01:25.395">with </span><span begin="01:25.395" end="01:26.658">parasites</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="0